---
import { generateGeneralInquiryUrl } from '../../utils/whatsapp';

const waConsultUrl = generateGeneralInquiryUrl('service-highlight');
---

<section class="py-6 sm:py-8 bg-[#efebe2] border-b border-[#dedad0] font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Shopify Clean Minimalist Style) -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-6 sm:mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-[#dedad0] gap-4">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#064e3b] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">
          Jasa Pembuatan Greenhouse
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1b2819] tracking-tight">
          Greenhouse yang Dirancang Sesuai Lahan, Komoditas &amp; Anggaran
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#485245] font-normal leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Pembuatan greenhouse tidak hanya tentang memilih jenis pipa atau bambu. Ukuran lahan, kecepatan angin tropis, orientasi sinar matahari, ventilasi monitor roof, atap plastik UV anti-drip, dan sistem fertigasi harus dirancang presisi sejak awal.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/jasa/pembuatan-greenhouse/#kalkulator"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#064e3b] hover:text-[#047857] transition-colors shrink-0"
      >
        <span>Kalkulator RAB Online</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Greenhouse Types Technical Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-5 mb-8 sm:mb-10">
      
      <!-- Type 1: Bambu -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#dedad0] hover:border-[#c8c3b7] hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 p-4 sm:p-5">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-[#e4e5da]/40 border border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-3.5">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/greenhouse-bambu.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Greenhouse Rangka Bambu Agrokomplek Cemerlang"
              width="600"
              height="375"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-2">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#064e3b]">Rangka Bambu Awet</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-medium text-[#485245] bg-[#e4e5da] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Ekonomis
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#1b2819] mb-1.5 group-hover:text-[#064e3b] transition-colors">
            Greenhouse Bambu Awet
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#485245] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">
            Pilihan ramah anggaran bagi kelompok tani dan pemula. Struktur bambu ori pilihan yang diawetkan dengan kuncian spring clip tahan terpaan angin.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#485245] border-t border-[#dedad0]/60 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Cocok untuk:</span> Sayuran daun, pembibitan, melon pemula</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Daya tahan:</span> 3 - 5 Tahun</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Penutup:</span> Plastik UV 14% &amp; Kasa Insect Net</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-3.5 border-t border-[#dedad0]/60">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang%2C%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Greenhouse%20Bambu."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#064e3b] hover:text-[#047857] flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Greenhouse Bambu</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 2: Galvanis (Komersial) -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl bg-white border-2 border-[#064e3b] hover:border-[#047857] shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 p-4 sm:p-5 relative">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-[#e4e5da]/40 border border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-3.5">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/greenhouse-galvanis.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Greenhouse Pipa Galvanis Komersial"
              width="600"
              height="375"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-2">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#064e3b]">Rangka Pipa Galvanis</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold bg-[#064e3b] text-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-2xs">
              Standar Komersial
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#1b2819] mb-1.5 group-hover:text-[#064e3b] transition-colors">
            Greenhouse Pipa Galvanis
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#485245] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">
            Investasi jangka panjang komersial dengan pipa galvanis hot-dip anti karat. Dirancang khusus untuk budidaya intensif bernilai ekonomi tinggi.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#485245] border-t border-[#dedad0]/60 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Cocok untuk:</span> Melon hidroponik, paprika, stroberi, tomat</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Daya tahan:</span> 10 - 15+ Tahun</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Fitur:</span> Monitor roof ventilation, sambungan klem tanpa las</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-3.5 border-t border-[#dedad0]/60">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang%2C%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Greenhouse%20Pipa%20Galvanis."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#064e3b] hover:text-[#047857] flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Greenhouse Galvanis</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 3: Baja Ringan -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#dedad0] hover:border-[#c8c3b7] hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 p-4 sm:p-5">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-[#e4e5da]/40 border border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-3.5">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/greenhouse-baja-ringan.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Greenhouse Rangka Baja Ringan"
              width="600"
              height="375"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-2">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#064e3b]">Rangka Baja Ringan</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-medium text-[#485245] bg-[#e4e5da] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Presisi Rapi
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#1b2819] mb-1.5 group-hover:text-[#064e3b] transition-colors">
            Greenhouse Baja Ringan
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#485245] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">
            Alternatif struktur presisi dengan perakitan ringkas dan bentang rapi. Sangat cocok untuk pembibitan (nursery) dan kebun sayur modern.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#485245] border-t border-[#dedad0]/60 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Cocok untuk:</span> Nursery, selada hidroponik, sayuran daun</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Daya tahan:</span> 7 - 10 Tahun</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Rangka:</span> Canal C 0.75mm + Reng Zincalume anti karat</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-3.5 border-t border-[#dedad0]/60">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang%2C%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Greenhouse%20Baja%20Ringan."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#064e3b] hover:text-[#047857] flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Baja Ringan</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 4: Tunnel Garam -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#dedad0] hover:border-[#c8c3b7] hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 p-4 sm:p-5">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-[#e4e5da]/40 border border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-3.5">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/tunnel-garam-greenhouse.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Tunnel Garam Prisma Pesisir"
              width="600"
              height="375"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#dedad0]/60 mb-2">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#064e3b]">Tunnel Garam Pesisir</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-medium text-[#485245] bg-[#e4e5da] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Geomembrane &amp; UV
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#1b2819] mb-1.5 group-hover:text-[#064e3b] transition-colors">
            Tunnel Garam Prisma
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#485245] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">
            Rumah kristalisasi garam tertutup dengan geomembrane HDPE dan plastik UV tahan garam laut. Panen garam meja bersih higienis tanpa terhenti musim hujan.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#485245] border-t border-[#dedad0]/60 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Cocok untuk:</span> Tambak garam meja, kristalisasi higienis</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Daya tahan:</span> 5 - 10 Tahun</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#1b2819]">Material:</span> Rangka lengkung anti korosi air laut &amp; HDPE</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-3.5 border-t border-[#dedad0]/60">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang%2C%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Tunnel%20Garam."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#064e3b] hover:text-[#047857] flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Tunnel Garam</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Callout Card -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl bg-[#064e3b] text-[#edeae1] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-md border border-[#047857]/60">
      <div class="space-y-2 max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300 uppercase tracking-wider block">
          Kalkulator Estimasi Biaya RAB
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
          Hitung Kebutuhan &amp; Estimasi Anggaran Lebih Awal
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#dedad0] leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Biaya pembuatan greenhouse dipengaruhi luas lahan, jenis rangka, spesifikasi plastik UV, ventilasi, dan instalasi fertigasi. Dapatkan estimasi biaya awal secara transparan melalui kalkulator kami.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto">
        <a
          href="/jasa/pembuatan-greenhouse/#kalkulator"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#efebe2] hover:bg-white text-[#1b2819] font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-normal transition-all shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Hitung RAB Greenhouse</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href={waConsultUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-[#edeae1] font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-normal transition-all border border-white/20"
        >
          <span>Konsultasi via WhatsApp</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
